[[8,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3025534\">5530B10</a></p><p>Disconnect the battery negative terminal.</p><p>1. Disconnect the water temperature sensor electrical connection.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Engine temperature sender unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024255\">K36</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo the thermostat water temperatur sensor and remove.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2002317.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[8,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Tighten the coolant temperature sensor\ninto the threaded seat on the thermostat.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>ENGINE COOLANT TEMPERATURE SENSOR.</p></td><td><p>M12 x 1.5</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>2</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the electrical connector.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Engine temperature sender unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024255\">K36</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the battery negative terminal.</p><p><a href=\"#/3025534\">5530B10</a></p>"],[16,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Proceed with removal <a href=\"#/3025751\">7025A12</a> .</p><p>Proceed with removal <a href=\"#/3025752\">7025A14</a> .</p><p>Proceed with removal <a href=\"#/3025001\">1016A10</a> .</p><p>Ensure that the ignition key is in the\nOFF position, then disconnect the negative battery terminal (-).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3023729\">A1B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection from the engine coolant\ntemperature sensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Engine temperature sender unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024255\">K36</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo and remove the engine coolant temperature sensor.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2048323.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[16,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the engine coolant temperature sensor\nback in its housing and tighten it to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>-</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the electrical connection to the\nengine coolant temperature sensor.</p><p>Connect the negative (-) battery terminal.</p><p>Proceed with refitting <a href=\"#/3025001\">1016A10</a> .</p><p>Proceed with refitting <a href=\"#/3025752\">7025A14</a> .</p><p>Proceed with refitting <a href=\"#/3025751\">7025A12</a> .</p>"]]